lls.', 450000, 'IDR', 1), ('Scrub Treatments', 'Mandi Chocolate Scrub (2 Hours)', 'Chocolate is proven to boost the moisture content of your skin, resulting in cell renewal.', 450000, 'IDR', 2), ('Scrub Treatments', 'Balinese Boreh Scrub (2 Hours)', 'A traditional exfoliation to rejuvenate skin as much as warming the body. Mixed of Clove, Ginger, Turmeric, Cinnamon, Nutmeg and Rice powder.', 450000, 'IDR', 3), ('Scrub Treatments', 'Cucumber or Carrot Scrub (2 Hours)', 'The massage is specially designed with a combination of shiatsu, deep tissue and Lomi-Lomi which is packed with a choice of cucumber or carrot scrub.', 385000, 'IDR', 4), ('Packages', 'Nyuh Sparkling Ritual (3.5 Hours)', 'A sparkling & eco-friendly package based on “Nyuh” (Balinese name for coconut) is a very known as a “multy benefits fruit”.', 650000, 'IDR', 0)) as i(sec, name, descr, price, cur, pos) on i.sec = secs.name;

